Description: Provides R access to Neglected Tropical Disease (NTD) data from
    two sources. The primary source is the ESPEN (Expanded Special Project for
    Elimination of Neglected Tropical Diseases) portal API, which covers all 7
    NTDs at both country and site level but requires an API key. As a no-
    authentication alternative, the package also wraps the WHO Global Health
    Observatory (GHO) OData API, which provides country-level onchocerciasis
    and trachoma indicators with no registration required. Users supply a
    country, disease, spatial level, and optional year range to receive a tidy
    data frame.
